          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the hardware hold up on Charleston or Hilton Head salt air?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. All spigots, connectors, hinges and latches are 2205 marine-grade stainless steel with a 10-year no-rust promise. Tempered glass is not affected by salt. On an oceanfront porch in Isle of Palms or a marsh-front deck in Bluffton, rinse the hardware with fresh water every few weeks. Both finishes, Brushed Stainless and Matte Black, share the same 2205 base.</p>",
